      "message": "To clarify,\nBy ln-to-file I meant symlink-to-file.\nAnd ln-to-dir meant symlink-do-dir.\nI am using a boolean OR operation.\nAnd ~fi.Mode()\u0026os.ModeSymlink !\u003d 0 ||~ fi.Mode()\u0026os.ModeDir \u003d\u003d 0 would not remove an existing symlink to a directory prior to attempting mkdir (and thus fail).",
